      "body": "smaller repro script:\n\n```py\nimport importlib.machinery\nimport importlib.util\ndummy_name = \"fake_extension_module_for_test\"\nloader = importlib.machinery.ExtensionFileLoader(dummy_name, __file__)\nspec = importlib.util.spec_from_loader(dummy_name, loader)\nmodule = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)\n```\n\nreproduces on macOS\n\n```\n$ ./python.exe -X faulthandler ../mre.py\nAssertion failed: (!_PyErr_Occurred(tstate)), function _PyObject_VectorcallDictTstate, file call.c, line 120.\nFatal Python error: Aborted\n\nCurrent thread 0x00000001f0020f40 (most recent call first):\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 491 in _call_with_frames_removed\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 1057 in create_module\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 816 in module_from_spec\n  File \"/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py\", line 6 in <module>\n\nCurrent thread's C stack trace (most recent call first):\n  <system returned no stack trace>\n[1]    44105 abort      ./python.exe -X faulthandler ../mre.py\n```\n\nfor reference, the import error when using non-debug 3.14 build:\n\n```\n$ uv run --python=3.14 ../mre.py                                                                                                           [10:15:10]\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py\", line 6, in <module>\n    module = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 816, in module_from_spec\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 1056, in create_module\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 491, in _call_with_frames_removed\nImportError: dlopen(/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py, 0x0002): tried: '/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py' (not a mach-o file), [...snip...], '/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/mre.py' (not a mach-o file)\n```",
