      "body": "I can confirm that with this patch applied (based on gh-141206), there's no assertion\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/Python/importdl.c b/Python/importdl.c\nindex 23a55c39677..885bbe9c5c3 100644\n--- a/Python/importdl.c\n+++ b/Python/importdl.c\n@@ -414,6 +414,7 @@ _PyImport_GetModuleExportHooks(\n         *modexport = (PyModExportFunction)exportfunc;\n         return 2;\n     }\n+    PyErr_Clear();\n\n     exportfunc = findfuncptr(\n         info->hook_prefixes->init_prefix,\n```\n\n```sh\n$ ./python.exe -X faulthandler ../mre.py\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py\", line 6, in <module>\n    module = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 816, in module_from_spec\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap_external>\", line 1057, in create_module\n  File \"<frozen importlib._bootstrap>\", line 491, in _call_with_frames_removed\nImportError: dlopen(/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py, 0x0002): tried: '/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/main-dbg/../mre.py' (not a mach-o file), [...], '/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/mre.py' (not a mach-o file), '/System/Volumes/Preboot/Cryptexes/OS/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/mre.py' (no such file), '/Users/itamaro/work/pybuild/mre.py' (not a mach-o file)\n```",
